---
description: >-
  Relations to names no requirement or element defines: v12 keeps them with
  undefined ends; v13 keeps them in the model, leaves them out of the layout
  and warns (D434).
---
requirementDiagram
  requirement known_req {
    id: 1
    text: a defined requirement
    risk: low
    verifymethod: analysis
  }

  element known_el {
    type: simulation
  }

  known_el - satisfies -> known_req
  ghost_el - satisfies -> known_req
  known_req - traces -> ghost_req
  ghost_a - derives -> ghost_b
